+
+- A throw from `beforeSession` still rejects to the caller, and reaches the same `catch` and `finally` as any other failure in the turn: `onError` receives the thrown error and `afterSession` fires after it ([validated by: runs onError and afterSession when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.beforeSession.acceptance.test.ts#L40), [validated by: called with the error a throwing beforeSession raised](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L284)).
